#. ja: 算術処理：偶数
#. de: Alle Geraden
#. fr: Énigme paire
#. column 1: Challenged by a riddle. Will result in punishment for those not standing on an even number when this effect expires.
msgctxt "Status:5148:0:0"
msgid "All Evens"
msgstr "Все чётные"

